OL,3,GNEWSAStation reopens to long distance
OL,4,Atrains after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA train station platform has reopened a
OL,7,Fmonth after a devastating fire.
OL,9,FNetwork Rail and Great Western Railway
OL,10,F(GWR) said full-length access will
OL,11,Fresume at platform two at Paignton
OL,12,FStation in Devon from Monday, allowing
OL,13,Fnine-carriage trains four days earlier
OL,14,Fthan previously expected.
OL,16,FLong-distance trains have been unable
OL,17,Fto call at the station, although it
OL,18,Freopened to local stopping services
OL,19,Fbetween Paignton and Newton Abbot which
OL,20,Fcould use the far end of the platform,
OL,21,Fa week after the fire on 21 July.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
